                    Board Meeting in<br>
                    Shreveport. The<br>
                    schedule will be dis-<br>
                    cussed at the LAA<br>
                    Annual Meeting No-<br>
                    vember 15.
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <div class="footer-page">8</div>
            <div class="footer-title">THE LOUISIANA ARCHITECT</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
